<title>USA: USDA to announce CRP enrollment Thursday.</title>
<headline>USDA to announce CRP enrollment Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretary Dan Glickman will announce on Thursday the final number of acres that will be accepted into the new Conservation Reserve Program as a result of the latest signup, the USDA announced Wednesday.</p>
<p>Glickman will make the announcement at 1000 EDT/1400 GMT, the department said.</p>
<p>The CRP is the largest federal environmental program in terms of acreage. Some 32.9 million acres are currently enrolled in the CRP.</p>
</text>
